# Copy to functions/.env and fill in before deploying.

# One-time super-admin bootstrap. Comma-separated list of email addresses that
# may claim the first super-admin seat by calling makeSuperAdmin on themselves.
#
# The seat can only be claimed once (guarded by the system/bootstrap document)
# and only by a caller whose email is verified. Leave this empty in production
# after the first admin exists — with no value set, the bootstrap path is closed
# and only existing super admins can grant admin rights.
BOOTSTRAP_SUPERADMIN_EMAIL=
